en:
//【舞殿宮】
<voice name='舞殿宮' class='舞殿宮' src='voice/mb01/0030020a10'>
//「やぁ、よう来てくれたね景明くん。
//　この間はご苦労さん。署長から聞いてるえ。
//またえらい迷惑掛けてもうたねえ」
"Hey, kid. Thanks for coming. And thanks for taking care of that business on the island. I heard from the chief. Sounds like it was rough."

pt:
//【舞殿宮】
<voice name='舞殿宮' class='舞殿宮' src='voice/mb01/0030020a10'>
//「やぁ、よう来てくれたね景明くん。
//　この間はご苦労さん。署長から聞いてるえ。
//またえらい迷惑掛けてもうたねえ」
"Ei, garoto. Obrigado por vir. E obrigado por cuidar daquele assunto na ilha. Fiquei sabendo pelo chefe. Parece que foi difícil."

en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0030030a00'>
//「はっ。
//　身に余る御言葉なれど、先日の件は宮殿下
//の御忠告を無下にせしこの身が自ら招いた事。
//どうか御気遣いは無用に願います」
"I would not have been in danger, Your Highness, had I not spurned your warning. Which, it turned out, was entirely justified."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0030030a00'>
//「はっ。
//　身に余る御言葉なれど、先日の件は宮殿下
//の御忠告を無下にせしこの身が自ら招いた事。
//どうか御気遣いは無用に願います」
"Não teria corrido perigo, Vossa Alteza, se eu não tivesse desprezado o vosso aviso. O qual, como se constatou, era inteiramente procedente."

en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0030040a00'>
//「しかも、肝心なる銀星号はまたしても取り
//逃がし、未だ跳梁を許している始末。
//　面目次第もございません」
"Moreover, I failed in my mission. Ginseigo remains a threat to all. As such, though it pains me, I cannot in good conscience accept Your Highness's gratitude."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0030040a00'>
