//気配が続いた。
//　そして、ずず、と衣擦れの音。
  The prince hesitates, but only for a moment. He did say the matter was pressing.

//　御簾の向こうで、親王もこちらへ近寄ったらしい。
  I hear a rustle behind the curtain, and his silhouette grows larger.

