"However you disguise the truth, if the shogun is assassinated at Hachiman Shrine, they will come to Your Highness for answers. And if they decide that you are guilty, then evidence or no..."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0031100a00'>
//「……では、その後の事を」
"...E㉓<I>depois,</I>㉒Vossa Alteza?"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb01/0031110a00'>
